bring combinator.tung
bring is.tung

## a type maker that taketh arrows backwards: a function from `β` to `α`
## contramappeth an `α φ` into a `β φ`.
show class contravariant: [φ: [*, *], *] {
  let contramap: [@α: *, @β: *, α φ, [β, α], β φ]

  let contramap_identity: [@α: *, a: α φ, (a contramap identity) = a]
}

## a function into `ρ` contramappeth its input: `(ρ ←)` taketh `α` to
## `[α, ρ]`.
bizen: [@ρ: *, (ρ ←) contravariant] {
  let contramap: [a:, f:, b:] ≔ (b f) a

  let contramap_identity: [_:] ≔ reflect
}
